From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SacredTrees <121399723+SacredTrees@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:30:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] [M68k] Prevent COPY instruction from killing live
 condition flags

Backport of upstream e7dd336e0f (llvm/llvm-project#168485) to Rust's
LLVM 22.1. A register copy placed between a compare and its branch
(MOVE sets the flags) made core::fmt::write miss the end of its
template and loop for ever. The two rmw.ll tests are regenerated for
this tree.

